OL,3,GNEWSAFeud murder accused 'didn't like'
OL,4,Avictim's family
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of murderously ramming a
OL,7,Fman on a petrol forecourt as part of a
OL,8,Ffamily feud has told jurors he "didn't
OL,9,Flike" the victim's relatives.
OL,11,FThe fatal attack on 23-year-old Daniel
OL,12,FAmbler at a petrol station in Seaham,
OL,13,FCounty Durham, in January came after
OL,14,Fmonths of incidents between his family
OL,15,Fand the Andersons, Teesside Crown Court
OL,16,Fheard.
OL,18,FBarry Anderson, 52, and his sons
OL,19,FAshton, 20, and Logan, 19, deny murder,
OL,20,Fas do Tyler Leadbetter and Ajay Henry,
OL,21,Fboth 18, who were passengers in the
OL,22,Fcar.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
